    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "此米四百十七石三斗四升五合五才"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "この米 四百十七石三斗四升五合五才／このまい 417.34505こく"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "This in rice: 417 koku 3 to 4 sho 5 go 5 sai (417.34505; the shaku place is skipped) — the rice equivalent of the 畑方正租 (dry-field land tax paid in cash) printed as the last column of the facing right leaf, 金貳千四百九拾兩永五文八分 = 2,490.0058 ryo, converted at the five-year average price given in the adjacent note: 417.34505 x 5.9663 = 2,490.0058 ryo exactly."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "前頁雜税此米"
      }
    ],
    "target": {
