      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "甲子より戊辰まで五ヶ年平均 代金五両三分永二百十六文三分／かっしよりぼしんまで ごかねんへいきん"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note (two sub-columns, right then left): averaged over the five years from Kasshi (1864) through Boshin (1868); price 5 ryo 3 bu and ei 216.3 mon = 5.9663 ryo per koku. Applying it to the preceding 417.34505 koku returns 2,490.0058 ryo, the 畑方正租 cash figure on the facing leaf."
